          "<strong class=\"coulson\">Agent Phil Coulson</strong> stops at a Roxxon Gas Station to fill up his car and two armed robbers enter the shop, he takes them both down. <strong class=\"coulson\">Phil Coulson</strong> reports the discovery of a <strong class=\"mcu\">large hammer </strong> at the bottom of a crater in a desert in New Mexico."
