        "rawHtml": "<h5>Agents Of S.H.I.E.L.D. <em>( Season 6: e01-e13 / 2019)</em></h5>\r\n                    <p>\r\n                        <strong class=\"coulson presumably-dead\">Sarge</strong>: Has Coulson's face, it's a shadow\r\n                        created by the explotion of the three monoliths.\r\n                        , <strong class=\"may\">Melinda May</strong>: dies at the end but Simmons put her in cryo to save\r\n                        her\r\n                        , <strong class=\"skye\">Daisy</strong>: blonde, goes looking for Fitz in Zephyr One throug space-\r\n                        , <strong class=\"secundary\">Leo Fitz</strong>: tries to survive space.\r\n                        , <strong class=\"secundary\">Jemma Simmons</strong>: separated from Fitz to save the Chronicoms\r\n                        and the team.\r\n                        , <strong class=\"secundary\">Mack</strong>: New director of SHIELD\r\n                        , <strong class=\"secundary\">Elena</strong>: almost killed by a shrike\r\n                        , <strong class=\"secundary presumably-dead\">Enoch</strong>: tries to save the Chronicoms\r\n                    </p>\r\n                    <p>\r\n                        <strong>Recovery Missions:</strong>Three Monoliths from the dark dimension, Coulson from Sarge.\r\n                    </p>\r\n                    <p>\r\n                        <strong>Enemies:</strong>\r\n                        <strong class=\"enemy dead\">Izel</strong>: died\r\n                        , <strong class=\"enemy dead\">Pachacutiq</strong>: inside Sarge\r\n                        , <strong class=\"enemy\">The Chronicoms</strong>: wants to travel to the past to save their world\r\n                    </p>\r\n                    <p>\r\n                        <strong>Secondary appearances: </strong>\r\n                        <strong class=\"secundary\">Deke</strong>: he is like Mark Zuckenberg.\r\n                    </p>",
