          "<strong class=\"coulson presumably-dead\">Sarge</strong>: Has Coulson's face, it's a shadow created by the explotion of the three monoliths. , <strong class=\"may\">Melinda May</strong>: dies at the end but Simmons put her in cryo to save her , <strong class=\"skye\">Daisy</strong>: blonde, goes looking for Fitz in Zephyr One throug space- , <strong class=\"secundary\">Leo Fitz</strong>: tries to survive space. , <strong class=\"secundary\">Jemma Simmons</strong>: separated from Fitz to save the Chronicoms and the team. , <strong class=\"secundary\">Mack</strong>: New director of SHIELD , <strong class=\"secundary\">Elena</strong>: almost killed by a shrike , <strong class=\"secundary presumably-dead\">Enoch</strong>: tries to save the Chronicoms",
