        "rawHtml": "<h5>Agents Of S.H.I.E.L.D. <em>( Season 5: e01-e10 / 2017)</em></h5>\r\n                        <p>\r\n                            <strong class=\"coulson\">Phil Coulson</strong>: Teleported to the future to save humanity but\r\n                            they get\r\n                            trapped in a temporal loop\r\n                            , <strong class=\"may\">Melinda May</strong>: suffers a wound when teleporting\r\n                            , <strong class=\"skye\">Daisy</strong>: \"The Destroyer of Worlds\" they think she destroyed\r\n                            it.\r\n                            Captured, Kasius wants to sell her to the best bidder, her powers are blocked\r\n                            , <strong class=\"secundary\">Leo Fitz</strong>: he came cryogenic to this year, to save the\r\n                            team.\r\n                            He dressed himself as a Marauder\r\n                            , <strong class=\"secundary\">Jemma Simmons</strong>: enslaved by Kasius. Saved by Fitz, asks\r\n                            Him\r\n                            to marry her\r\n                            , <strong class=\"secundary\">Mack</strong>: In love with Elena\r\n                            , <strong class=\"secundary\">Elena</strong>: She meets herself from the future, her hands are\r\n                            amputated.\r\n                            She warns her not to save Phil, but to save the world\r\n                            , <strong class=\"secundary\">Enoch</strong>: an \"anthropologist\" chronicom. Takes the team to\r\n                            the\r\n                            future\r\n                            and travels with Fitz to the future.\r\n                        </p>\r\n                        <p>\r\n                            <strong>Recovery Missions:</strong> Daisy's powers and the Monolith to the past.\r\n                        </p>\r\n                        <p>\r\n                            <strong>Enemies:</strong>\r\n                            <strong class=\"enemy dead\">Kasius</strong>: a Kree overlord who runs The Lighthouse and\r\n                            slaved\r\n                            the last remaining of the human race.\r\n                            , <strong class=\"enemy dead\">Sinara</strong>: Kasius second hand and lover.\r\n                        </p>\r\n                        <p>\r\n                            <strong>Secondary appearances: </strong>\r\n                            <strong class=\"secundary\">Deke</strong>: a mercenary that turns to help the team\r\n                            <strong class=\"secundary\">Flint</strong>: an inhuman boy that can move and model stone,\r\n                            constructed the Monolith for the team.\r\n                        </p>\r\n                        <p>\r\n                            <strong>Places: </strong> <em class=\"dead\">The Lighthouse</em>: the last bastion of the\r\n                            destroyed Earth.\r\n                            Gets destroyed when the team gets back to the past.\r\n                        </p>",
